    "normalModeMultiplierPath": "slot.tumbles[].symbols.out[].win.multiplier",
    "notes": "Package 5 slot. Launcher id 00260326. Frame URL /titanic/. PROBE-005 (2026-10-15) opened the buy panel from the HUD BUY pill. Two choices: buyFeatureOption1 Slay Queen's Gem v.1 at 100x (Random Scatter 3-7, start multiplier 1x); buyFeatureOption2 v.2 at 500x (start multiplier 2x). Confirm is the bottom BUY FEATURE pill at 0.500,0.929. Close is the glyph at 0.921,0.248. Scratch drawer ratios are still the shared Package 5 panel. The multiplier is the background on a winning cell. PROBE-006 recorded slot.tumbles[].symbols.out[].win.multiplier, and later cascades paid the sum of cells that had already won earlier in the same spin. Max win is 5,000x. Buy tier 1 (100x, \"Start Multipliers: 1x\") opens with every cell unmarked (0) by design; only tiers of 2x and above pre-mark the board (tier 2 opens all 2). Confirmed with the game owner 2026-10-26."
